  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The sky turns into a grey rock battlefield that expands to cover those inside. From outside it looks like a huge grey rock cloud hanging in the sky, blocking vision.",
      "chapters": [
        723
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "High in the air it is massive, like a poisonous tumor attached to Starry Sky grotto-heaven.",
      "chapters": [
        725
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_starry_sky_grotto_heaven"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Star Lord Wan Xiang turns into a shooting star and flies into the eighth star hall; Fang Yuan and Hei Lou Lan bet the defenses are no longer a threat and follow him in.",
      "chapters": [
        723
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_star_lord_wan_xiang",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_hei_lou_lan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Seven Star Child’s immortal zombie flies out of the eighth star hall, its attention locks on the rolling rock battlefield high in the air. The field is massive, like a poisonous tumor attached to Starry Sky grotto-heaven. An immortal star path killer move, star billow pillar, crashes into it; the battlefield shakes but does not break.",
      "chapters": [
        725
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "pressure-on-the-field",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_seven_star_child"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Under further immortal killer moves, including a huge starlight hand, the battlefield cracks open and still holds for a time, then finally breaks. When it does, the wounded zombie dragon falls, and Shi Lei emerges heavily injured.",
      "chapters": [
        726
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "pressure-on-the-field",
